1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,100
R. War is horrible. During any war, terrible things occur.

2
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:13,740
The result is painful memories and disfiguring scars

3
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,780
for the very people needed to rebuild a war-torn country.

4
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,380
The leaders of every country must learn

5
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:41,740
that wars are never won, lives are always lost, and history is doomed to repeat

6
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:51,100
itself unless we all decide to live in harmony with our brothers and sisters.
